  "slug": "peach-guacamole",
  "name": "Peach Guacamole",
  "recipe_type": "appetizer",
  "brief_description": "This peach guacamole recipe features fresh, juicy peaches and the slightly earthy and spicy notes of ancho chile to give ordinary guacamole an upgrade.",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Mash avocados in a small bowl. Stir in lime juice and ancho chile powder; season with salt. Stir in peach, red onion, cilantro, and jalape\u00f1o."
    }
  ],
